    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not the equipment, i'm just using my naked eye and a tripod, but the cadence is too specific to be just \"noise.\" it felt... intentional. like it was reacting to me being out there. the sequence was 3-short, pause, 2-fast. then it did 1-long, 1-short. if this is a transmission, it's not just light, it's data. can you look at those specific intervals (3-pause-2 then 1-pause-1) and see if they correlate to any known mathematical constants or prime number sequences? please, i really feel like this is important.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
